==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 88% HP:
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Build up [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] near the Cat Base alongside meatshields, and destroy the enemy base before Zackie Pengs can cause a problem.

